          "text": "HÛRHAN, 扈爾漢, 1576–1623, Nov. 13, belonged to the branch of the Tunggiya 佟佳 clan which settled at Yarhû 雅爾古. His father, Hûlahû 扈喇虎, after a disagreement with other members of the clan, came to join Nurhaci [q.v.] in 1588.",
